The desktop build links FFmpeg. FFmpeg is licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later, but a
distribution built with `--enable-gpl` (as most Linux distributions ship it) is
GPL. Anyone redistributing binaries of this project should link an
LGPL-configured FFmpeg (`--disable-gpl --disable-nonfree`) and comply with the
LGPL, or omit the video backend.
